Package: com.cysxl.settingswidgets
Name: SettingsWidgets
Version: 2.0.16
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Conflicts: com.shepgoba.settingswidgets
Replaces: com.shepgoba.settingswidgets
Provides: com.shepgoba.settingswidgets
Description: A fork of shepgoba's SettingsWidgets.
 Adds widgets to the top of the Settings page.
 * show battery health, storage, Wi-Fi, cellular, hotspot & Bluetooth.
 * respring or enter safe mode from the utility widget.
 * arrange up to four widgets in two rows.
 * set an image or GIF background per widget.
 * show hotspot clients from HotspotPro.
Author: shepgoba, CySxL
Maintainer: CySxL
Icon: https://cysxl.github.io/icons/com.cysxl.settingswidgets.png
Section: Tweaks
